# ALLOW-LIST, do not convert this back to a deny-list.
#
# `vercel --prod` from the CLI uploads the local working directory, not the git
# tree, so .gitignore does NOT protect anything here. A deny-list previously let
# CravioLabs_GoToMarket_Phase3.docx and the reference PDFs deploy to production.
#
# Everything at the top level is excluded, then only the files that make up the
# website are added back. Anything new is excluded by default, which is the
# behaviour we want.

/*

!/index.html
!/robots.txt
!/sitemap.xml
!/assets
# the three concept project pages. Omitting these 404'd every /work/ URL in
# the sitemap and every "See the full concept" link on the homepage.
!/work
